{title: Lamha Lamha Doori}
{artist: Abhijeet Pritam Raaz 2}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C]Lamha Lamha Doori Yun [F]Pighalti Hai,        [F]Jane Kis Aag [G]Me Ye Shabnam [C]Jalti Hai
[C]Khwaahishon Ki Shaam [F]Dhalti [G]Hai,        [F]Jane Kis Aag [G]Me Ye Shabnam [C]Jalti Hai
[C]La [G]La [F]La [C]La...        [C]Teri Aankhen Dikhati [Am]Hai
Hamein [Dm]Sapanen Sitaaron [G]Ke Ho..        [C]Tere Hothon Pe Likha [Am]Hai
Jo Tum [Dm]Bole Ishaaron [G]Mein..Ho,        [C]Khwabo Ke Karwaan Me Raat [F]Chalti Hai
[F]Jane Kis Aag [G]Me Ye Shabnam [C]Jalti Hai,        [C]La [G]La [F]La [C]La...
[C]Behakti Shaam Aayi [Am]Hai,        Tujhe [Dm]Lekar Ke Baahon [G]Mein..Ho
[C]Tujhe Chhu Loon Ke Rakhu [Am]Main,        Chhupakar [Dm]Ke Nigaahon [G]Mein..Ho
[C]Sharmati Ithlaati Hai [F]Machalti Hai,        [F]Jane Kis Aag [G]Me Ye Shabnam [C]Jalti Hai
[C]Lamha Lamha Doori Yun [F]Pighalti Hai..
